# .env.example

Root environment example documenting all required keys with safe placeholders.
**NEVER commit real values.**

## Core
API_VERSION=v1
APP_ENV=development
DEBUG=false

## Backend
BACKEND_HOST=0.0.0.0
BACKEND_PORT=8000
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://eyedx:eyedx@localhost:5432/eyedx  # INPUT_REQUIRED (real creds)
JWT_SECRET_KEY=CHANGE_ME_IN_SECURE_ENV  # INPUT_REQUIRED - min 32 chars
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRY_MINUTES=60

## Model Service
MODEL_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:8001  # INPUT_REQUIRED per deployment
MODEL_VERSION=1.0.0  # INPUT_REQUIRED (must match registry)

## Storage
STORAGE_BACKEND=local  # INPUT_REQUIRED: local|s3
STORAGE_PATH=./storage/uploads

## CORS
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000  # INPUT_REQUIRED (comma-separated in prod)

## ML/Registry
MODEL_REGISTRY_PATH=./model_registry  # INPUT_REQUIRED if using local registry

## Notes
- All values marked CHANGE_ME or with comment INPUT_REQUIRED must be supplied securely
- No patient data, model weights, or clinical values
- DEBUG=false in production
- For absent inputs, services must handle safely and fail fast with clear messages
